:Namespace Stats
⍝ .apln: a namespace, a named group of related functions (and variables).
⍝   Stats.Mean 2 4 9   →   5

    Mean←{(+/⍵)÷≢⍵}
    Median←{s←⍵[⍋⍵] ⋄ n←≢⍵ ⋄ Mean s[(⌈n÷2),1+⌊n÷2]}
    Range←{(⌈/⍵)-⌊/⍵}
    SD←{(Mean(⍵-Mean ⍵)*2)*0.5}

    ∇ r←Summary v
    ⍝ A tradfn inside a namespace
      r←'mean' 'median' 'sd',[1.5](Mean v)(Median v)(SD v)
    ∇

    ∇ Run
    ⍝ Called automatically when this file is loaded at startup
    ⍝ (`dyalog Stats.apln`): a namespace's Run is its entry point.
      ⎕←'Stats loaded. Example: Stats.Summary 3 1 4 1 5 9'
      ⎕←Summary 3 1 4 1 5 9
    ∇
:EndNamespace
